[{"title":"水碓","author":"张吉","text":"万转冰轮挟雪飞，俄然飞去复来归。\n欲拈匕箸还思睡，几粒盘餐触骇机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50719,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水硙","author":"张吉","text":"眼空心正齿参差，不法工倕法偃师。\n我有一车三百辐，肯教轻易水心湄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50720,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊洪福寺前大水","author":"张吉","text":"灶底蛙声木上罾，洪涛灭尽各村灯。\n船头佛脚疑相并，只好低徊对野僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50721,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖水涨入龙头山无复畔岸舟人迷惑误入兴真观会道士茶话戏题一绝","author":"张吉","text":"柔橹萦迂度林杪，落花深处闻啼鸟。\n仙翁出洞笑相迎，流水悠然天杳杳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50722,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莫投上叶村二绝 其一","author":"张吉","text":"白妥红殷翠欲匀，小园犹见未残春。\n盘中细蕨兼新笋，更喜山家味最真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50723,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莫投上叶村二绝 其二","author":"张吉","text":"野翁短发乱鬙鬙，门外春山懒自登。\n独有池鱼堪饭客，日斜閒放两三罾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50724,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过羊桥峡","author":"张吉","text":"千寻绝壁凌丹阙，百丈飞泉坠碧潭。\n半醉中流一俯仰，此身疑与列仙参。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50725,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兵书峡","author":"张吉","text":"悬崖一椟古嶙峋，百箭纷披激水滨。\n恐有鬼仙曾脱骨，谓韬兵法却非真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50726,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沉香岩","author":"张吉","text":"岩广垂空万木斜，仰窥如对镜中花。\n吏人报道三年外，尚有沉香积数车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50727,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金利水口","author":"张吉","text":"野童笑入青萝去，门掩江声落日斜。\n一段风光催客棹，傍人莫问脚头赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50728,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄田坂中","author":"张吉","text":"笋舆悬度百家庄，道道渠泉版版墙。\n二月生涯巳盈目，麦波苍翠菜花黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50729,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿康驿读韩都宪诗刻","author":"张吉","text":"江亭此刻不模糊，二十馀年寇难除。\n灯火夜谈听父老，相公开府在苍梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50730,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"封川馆中书尧夫游伊洛诗因述此","author":"张吉","text":"荼因味苦难成啜，花到春深不可移。\n独掩半扉无一事，戏书康节数联诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50731,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南津阻风","author":"张吉","text":"风留客舫南津口，独语苍头欲暮天。\n微火渐温茶鼎沸，绕篷添得荔枝烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50732,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶州","author":"张吉","text":"曲江山色青于染，点破遥空数片云。\n柔橹晚经清绝处，客愁应减两三分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50733,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客南征","author":"邹智","text":"疏雨不复月，蟋蟀空自鸣。\n出门送佳客，正值新月晴。\n月晴已足嘉，况复惊波平。\n君知爱月意，莫惜清宵征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50734,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槐阴午坐","author":"邹智","text":"溽暑浑如蒸，槐阴殊可爱。\n招邀馆中英，趺坐一解带。\n蚁战疑有屯，鸟度知无碍。\n烦襟聊尔清，吏胥趣晚会。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50735,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日写怀 其一","author":"邹智","text":"秋风策策鸣，秋水盈盈隔。\n抱膝坐虚斋，有怀长自结。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50736,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日写怀 其二","author":"邹智","text":"昨日楚人来，前日巴人到。\n入门问苍生，苍生日凋耗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50737,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日写怀 其三","author":"邹智","text":"剪瓜宜及肤，割发宜及体。\n肉食者何人，视之如逆旅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50738,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日写怀 其四","author":"邹智","text":"茱萸赐朝士，一士分一枝。\n君恩岂不浓，民瘼谁当医。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50739,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日写怀 其五","author":"邹智","text":"东邻有醇酒，可以浇清愁。\n苍生倚大臣，不必书生忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50740,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄汝脩还天台","author":"邹智","text":"天台有一士，独抱男子肠。\n立朝五六年，敛退藏锋芒。\n人皆疑其圆，我独疑其方。\n一朝解牙牌，上疏辞君王。\n问之何因尔，耻对妾妇妆。\n牙牌一飘瓦，碎尽何足伤。\n白璧苟微瑕，此恨千古长。\n我闻定轩翁，古道恒自将。\n见子慷慨归，喜极当欲狂。\n春风扇微和，天台花正香。\n请君陟其巅，挹彼武夷苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50741,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴献臣令顺德","author":"邹智","text":"熠耀非自燃，蝙蝠非自沸。\n盈盈天地间，孰非天地字。\n君侯人中英，经纶有高致。\n欲分四海忧，当自一邑试。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50742,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬吴顺德 其一","author":"邹智","text":"吾儿即公儿，公母即吾母。\n公母抚吾儿，何异吾母抚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50743,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬吴顺德 其二","author":"邹智","text":"所虑儿太烈，出入不可制。\n或时走城闉，或时临水次。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50744,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬吴顺德 其三","author":"邹智","text":"南衙钱二缗，尽散公两仆。\n我欲抱儿勤，公莫让私蓄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50745,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬吴顺德 其四","author":"邹智","text":"主人赤脚汉，欲赁西城夫。\n自言夫颇閒，一任吾儿呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50746,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬吴顺德 其五","author":"邹智","text":"我处赤脚久，其心真可信。\n一以为吾儿，一以为穷困。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50747,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬吴顺德 其六","author":"邹智","text":"平生壮士气，可以摧三军。\n念儿到中宵，销尽不复存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50748,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬吴顺德 其七","author":"邹智","text":"家书几时封，幸为封仔细。\n封讫写路程，庶几易传递。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50749,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬吴顺德 其八","author":"邹智","text":"白发披高堂，悠悠七千里。\n遥思念我心，宁独止于此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50750,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬吴顺德 其九","author":"邹智","text":"去年犹有泪，今年惟有血。\n寄与田承君，事与道乡别。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感","author":"邹智","text":"山木有时枯，江鱼有时渴。\n人生天地间，岂能千古活。\n渴者非自乾，枯者非自割。\n人惟人其人，生杀天予夺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人作县丞","author":"邹智","text":"作县如作室，作官如作工。\n斧者奔而西，锯者趋而东。\n执事虽不齐，所期在成功。\n君本蜀中彦，素以才自雄。\n我观吞吐间，绝非吴下蒙。\n今承梓人旨，百里生斤风。\n有玉正当错，有刀正当砻。\n勿论简与烦，勿计卑与崇。\n但令间架立，也足为帡幪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽吴孟谦","author":"邹智","text":"忆昨边事棘，君遇我畏垒。\n君裳甚萧疏，君坐独㟪?。\n坐久竟无言，言辄无破䃣。\n我时心异君，蓄缩不敢揣。\n继与长官俱，长官亦推美。\n谓从君到来，庶几悉君委。\n公庭静于寺，诗思清于水。\n寻闻漕运归，病笃不复頠。\n长官对我言，泪落如泉?。\n念君清流才，下与诸掾遗。\n辛苦三十年，化作殊方鬼。\n我病渴未消，送君不临氿。\n寂寞短乎章，聊以当君诔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50754,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘汝德还蜀","author":"邹智","text":"两地八千里，忍看生别离。\n最知忧道切，不是爱山痴。\n晚雨虽微急，晨光本自熹。\n明年二三月，正是望君时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50755,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿祖母","author":"邹智","text":"天开当子月，祖寿起寅年。\n善本殷勤积，家惟澹泊传。\n乾坤尧舜禹，日月坐行眠。\n遥忆高堂上，冰桃似水鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50756,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李训导之官","author":"邹智","text":"先生万人杰，起自锦江滨。\n天上逢尧舜，人间养凤麟。\n淳风千古吹，化雨一番新。\n国朝青史上，有传表儒臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50757,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上林春色 其一","author":"邹智","text":"今年春色早，惟有上林先。\n蛰起惊雷下，冰消杲日前。\n枯株扶冉冉，嫩草踏芊芊。\n东风随处到，造化本无偏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50758,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上林春色 其二","author":"邹智","text":"今年春色丽，惟有上林明。\n暖日崇桃映，疏星积李横。\n碧鸡临水舞，黄鸟逐人鸣。\n东风随处点，造化本无情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50759,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上林春色 其三","author":"邹智","text":"今年春色透，惟有上林深。\n石山开遍锦，谷雨溜成金。\n拆发程颐谏，移栽赵鼎箴。\n东风随处补，造化本无心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50760,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"邹智","text":"自笑冒巢氄，犹能万里飞。\n佩韦知已晚，刻鹄此其几。\n清栱光华远，高堂信息稀。\n孤舟如可挽，野水莫相违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50761,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨兴用杨方震韵","author":"邹智","text":"夜诵香初烬，晨兴鬓尚蓬。\n风严凝水立，雨净见天空。\n饮药殊无效，澄心间有功。\n不知天地里，何处是途穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50762,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宽斋卷","author":"邹智","text":"迂径荒茫外，云庄缥缈中。\n叶粘寒露落，花听雨声红。\n凝重黄通老，和平吕伯恭。\n更应泥塑坐，渣滓尽销镕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50763,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松泉卷","author":"邹智","text":"岭树重重合，江流曲曲深。\n乱云时出没，寒月夜浮沉。\n飞鸟争深港，游鱼度密林。\n黑龙浑不起，时复抱珠吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽欧阳先生","author":"邹智","text":"紫诏初黄发，青骡竟白云。\n枯荣真梦觉，今古一朝矄。\n人往仪刑在，坟高草树分。\n子孙俱俊彦，足以答明君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄贺冯指挥","author":"邹智","text":"殄扑须骁捷，绥怀仗老成。\n静观诸将遍，莫是此公并。\n野店开门宿，深山放胆行。\n驱驰三十载，髀肉未全生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50766,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海行遭风次献臣韵","author":"邹智","text":"今夕知何夕，浮生又网罗。\n真成抱空月，无计障颓波。\n粗比尧夫幸，终惭叔子多。\n穷途仗神道，聊复对君歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50767,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送丁太平之任","author":"邹智","text":"元化都凭岳牧宣，丁侯今领广山川。\n琅函锦帙诗三百，烁石流金路几千。\n能识乾坤均父母，可令兄弟独颠连。\n太平有象真难致，莫道文官不爱钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50768,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太液池观莲","author":"邹智","text":"凤辇初临太液池，池中君子肃朝仪。\n清香冉冉风舒卷，疏影沉沉月正欹。\n抱负胸中应有实，经纶天下岂无丝。\n太平更得君王宠，万种繁华总不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉堂槐","author":"邹智","text":"一自文皇植此根，累朝培养更殷勤。\n地清半拟三公位，天近争看列宿分。\n宿德应生真宰相，雄才宁羡大将军。\n老蛟堕地如人立，震电惊雷只乱蚊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"内垣芍药","author":"邹智","text":"暖风作伴彩云妆，笑倚宫墙夜有光。\n五鼎味中知自别，万花会里定谁强。\n稚圭北起延开宝，介甫南来致靖康。\n世道盛衰真差异，天几先露一围黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新燕","author":"邹智","text":"白玉堂开日正迟，瞥然惊见燕儿飞。\n荼蘼架远和烟度，玳瑁梁高戴月归。\n小掠芹泥犹怯冷，初沾杏雨未生肥。\n千言万语无人会，只付东风主是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘御史致政西还","author":"邹智","text":"中外飞扬二十春，黑头先已厌红尘。\n才登殿上朝元辟，便入山中侍老亲。\n张禹悠悠终误国，范滂谔谔竟危身。\n风流孰与陶元亮，自是羲皇以上人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"邹智","text":"两年孤负切云冠，已觉清羸带眼宽。\n梅大十围应自白，葵长一丈为谁丹。\n剑如可借朱槐里，股不能箕管幼安。\n时止时行熊掌在，百年分付史臣看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送温重廉还临江","author":"邹智","text":"差见临江第一仙，丹崖青壁欲生烟。\n祥鸾忽报当年信，灵鹊真成此夕缘。\n元献眼高应绝世，文忠才大合擎天。\n临岐预作重逢约，红杏香中早着鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋赏月 其一","author":"邹智","text":"一年初识此公楼，纵不能诗也合留。\n北极光华南极是，今人风致古人求。\n仰登玉宇非无路，共济苍生合有舟。\n尘鬓照来全未白，乘风好溯泰山游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋赏月 其二","author":"邹智","text":"天地中间共倚楼，夜深犹自挽衣留。\n白榆丹桂端谁见，玉兔银蟾莫浪求。\n活水照人真宝鉴，浮名于我本虚舟。\n诗逢大将应难敌，况拥雄兵据上游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和刑部诸公赏菊韵二首 其一","author":"邹智","text":"浊思如何岂易胶，微官聊复得閒劳。\n晚香敢谓安阳淡，真意还输栗里高。\n万叶乱飞孤此杰，三秋中赏定谁曹。\n一声长啸非难事，莫向花前浪郁陶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50778,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和刑部诸公赏菊韵二首 其二","author":"邹智","text":"写尽寒烟与败胶，爱花宁厌赏花劳。\n酒兵入阵霜初破，诗将登坛月正高。\n绝俗自宜莲并价，策勋当与杞同曹。\n故知逸兴真难尽，更约明年共和陶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50779,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送董庶子使朝鲜","author":"邹智","text":"天启休符又戊申，独衔紫诏下枫宸。\n弛张仰见真文武，出入争看老凤麟。\n七叶皇风清八道，百年高节重千钧。\n文章光烛烟霄上，未是中朝第一珍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50780,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘侍讲使安南","author":"邹智","text":"圣主龙飞九五天，只从尧舜接真传。\n豁开日月云俱静，运转风雷化自宣。\n司马携僮归政府，紫阳抱道侍经筵。\n使轺未度东津水，已震西南万里边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50781,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林居鲁之杭州","author":"邹智","text":"古貌堂堂两汉儒，直从心地做工夫。\n笑挥豸角嚣尘静，勇犯龙鳞睿眷纾。\n南斗星高光北斗，东湖梅老主西湖。\n芳心未用愁迟暮，天上灵脩目正盱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50782,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻二祖父三祖父皆以年冠带诗以志喜末句悲先祖父之不起也呜呼一喜一悲之间其所感者深矣孝子慈孙尚思所以惜时爱日以尽养志之诚也哉","author":"邹智","text":"铁杖扶来八十年，金函开诏沐龙涎。\n鹿胎软衬蝉冠正，鱼佩高悬鹤氅鲜。\n俯仰山中閒宰相，醉醒世上活神仙。\n泷冈未表乾封固，万里孙儿泪洒天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50783,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李天瑞之咸宁 其一","author":"邹智","text":"立马卢沟话壮游，关河西去道途脩。\n忠肝义胆谁当傅，白日青天本自秋。\n千古天纲嗟鹿角，百年臣节仰鱼头。\n圣贤步步皆平地，莫向空中浪倚楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50784,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李天瑞之咸宁 其二","author":"邹智","text":"世道悠悠几日还，上方无剑斩穷奸。\n跛麟载笔真辞阙，孤鹤乘风欲渡关。\n履善自能歌正气，季通端不动愁颜。\n丈夫惜别非无泪，不向忠臣此日潸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50785,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送夏廷璋还南都","author":"邹智","text":"南国衣冠子胜流，相逢便与啖元脩。\n初怪眼中无皂白，岂知皮里有春秋。\n交游独我联貂尾，廊庙何人重笔头。\n一寸丹心危欲折，梦魂夜夜绕龙楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50786,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同乡李大器先生试教官不第受散官以归此虽旧例然待常调者多恋恋不忍舍先生此举亦为奇特云","author":"邹智","text":"玉河寒溜隔桥鸣，共立桥边恰五更。\n逸鸟岂能粘以网，化虫犹自挶于茎。\n道乡居士何年定，少室山人此日成。\n老马似知离别意，徘徊柳下到天明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50787,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶得寒疾一汗而愈寄伯瞻","author":"邹智","text":"此身本与两仪齐，造化谁云是小儿。\n必有事焉元自欠，罔之生也竟何为。\n华陀自古真难遇，邹浩从今不用悲。\n却恐故人疏太甚，枯梅无复长新枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50788,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]